# The ask side empties for a while, then comes back.
#
# While there are no asks (excluding our own), the book is invalid: the app
# must skip requoting but leave its resting quotes alone. When asks return,
# it requotes.
#
# Participants: 2 and 3 provide the book.

latency market_data 5_000
latency order_entry 10_000
timer 1_000_000
end 20_000_000

0            2 enter 1 B 500 100.00
0            2 enter 2 B 400 99.99
0            3 enter 1 S 500 100.01
0            3 enter 2 S 400 100.02

# All market asks pulled. Our own ask is still resting, but it doesn't count.
5_000_000    3 cancel 1
5_000_100    3 cancel 2

# Bids move while the ask side is empty: no requote.
7_000_000    2 enter 3 B 200 100.01
8_000_000    2 cancel 1

# Asks return, higher: 100.01 x 100.04. Both quotes move up.
12_000_000   3 enter 3 S 300 100.04
12_000_000   3 enter 4 S 300 100.05
